sequenceDiagram

  actor 1 as ASM+ User<br />[Person]
  participant 19 as ASM+ Web Application<br />[Container: React, Vite, Node static server]
  participant 26 as Document Viewer<br />[Container: React, Vite, Node static server]
  participant 32 as Auth API<br />[Container: Node.js, TypeScript, Express; port 3000]
  participant 38 as ASM+ API<br />[Container: Node.js, TypeScript, Express; port 3000]
  participant 63 as ASM Storage API<br />[Container: Node.js, TypeScript, Express; port 3000]
  participant 8 as Cloud Storage<br />[Software System]

  1->>19: Chooses a document<br />[HTTPS]
  19->>26: Launches the Viewer with document context<br />[HTTPS]
  26->>32: Validates the user/application session<br />[HTTPS/JSON, JWT]
  26->>38: Requests metadata and binary content<br />[HTTPS/JSON and HTTP range]
  38->>63: Requests the stored component<br />[HTTP/REST, X-Api-Key]
  63->>8: Streams the object, including HTTP range support<br />[GCS API over HTTPS]